    "body": "DUNCAN PRE-ACTION ENFORCEMENT — SANDBOX EVIDENCE\n\nHEAD = `2065030a441c7d7c37c186357fcd1451f5fbf49f`\nPR = #205 / OPEN / DRAFT / NOT MERGED\n\nROOT CAUSE CLOSED:\nverified learning previously ended at a policy prefix and had no deterministic veto immediately before a substantive action.\n\nIMPLEMENTED:\n- `scripts/hq_pre_action.py`\n- contract `ZB_PRE_ACTION_DECISION_V1`\n- decisions `ALLOW / WAIT / BLOCK / OWNER_REQUIRED`\n- reuses existing `build_learning_policy()`; no daemon, DB, runner, model service, polling, or dependency added\n- `AGENTS.md` now requires the gate before each substantive action\n- explicit honest boundary: repository gate does not claim to physically intercept native ChatGPT tool calls\n\n2026-08-31 INCIDENT REPLAY:\n1. exact OWNER asset + SEARCH_ASSET -> `BLOCK / EXACT_OWNER_INPUT_SUPERSEDES_SEARCH`\n2. proven prerequisite + VERIFY_PREREQUISITE -> `BLOCK / PREREQUISITE_ALREADY_PROVEN`\n3. PROCESS_MUTATION without proven process blocker -> `BLOCK / PROCESS_MUTATION_REQUIRES_PROVEN_PROCESS_BLOCKER`\n4. active attempt + new mutation -> `WAIT / ACTIVE_ATTEMPT_OWNS_PATH`\n5. OWNER relay without proven external boundary -> `BLOCK / OWNER_IS_NOT_A_COURIER`\nHistorical-loop prevention coverage = `5/5`.\n\nAdditional hard gates:\n- PASS claim requires fresh verification evidence\n- image mutation requires explicit OWNER image-mutation command\n- repeat process mutation requires a new physical blocker\n- proven external boundary returns OWNER_REQUIRED\n\nTDD:\n- RED run `33374299538`: 15 failures because pre-action gate did not exist\n- focused implementation run `33374585121`: 14/15 behavior tests green; one direct-CLI import bug exposed\n- CLI repair HEAD `eca33a8bdcb0ee75031e164e56f5348fd902b592`, run `33374659763`: hq-schema/full unittest PASS, scope guard PASS, Control Tower integrity PASS\n- bootstrap-binding RED HEAD `45d6b0a13adccb036747f4011c0baba167337d44`: hq-schema FAIL on missing AGENTS pre-action binding\n- final HEAD `2065030a441c7d7c37c186357fcd1451f5fbf49f`, hq-validate run `33374793545`: hq-schema PASS, full unittest PASS, scope guard PASS, Control Tower integrity PASS\n\nSECURITY CHECK BOUNDARY:\n`foss-audit` remains red because gitleaks scans repository history and finds two pre-existing historical matches at commits `b8ac3f94963888ce1b6516680f880db42f832b46` and `3ef5fdcb50e527c12a7abefe552ba9e2fc7892f2`. The same foss-audit failure is present on prior HEAD `eca33a8bdcb0ee75031e164e56f5348fd902b592`; it is not introduced by the pre-action gate or AGENTS binding. Do not relabel global security as PASS.\n\nPRE_ACTION_BASE_SANDBOX = PASS\nGLOBAL_FOSS_AUDIT = PREEXISTING_HISTORY_BLOCKER\nMERGE = NO\nPRODUCTION_ACTIVATION = NO\nMODEL_WEIGHTS_CHANGED = NO",
